      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NATES FURY (1) ran well two back when hitting the frame then out of the placings at Goulburn latest but returns to a course where he has performed well. Key player on best and worth another chance. IRINKA FRED (7) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by 1.3 lengths at Temora in a handy 18.73 beating Ascend Jacaranda. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Leading chance again. ARMOURED GLASS (6) missed the frame last time at this track but the start prior rocketed around 330m at Temora in 18.92. Has the ability and can find winning form again. BELL MAC MAGIC (2) is last start winner who looks one of the chances.",
